OL,3,AThree arrests at rival protests in
OL,4,APortsmouth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old Portsmouth man was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of obstructing a
OL,8,Fhighway and criminal damage, and a
OL,9,F16-year-old boy was arrested on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of violent disorder linked to
OL,11,Fa similar protest at Eastney Marina on
OL,12,FSunday.
